{"title":"새벽빛의 노래","artist":"Sound Horizon","sourceId":"reference:8bcin8AJNNhWLSoX99ea","sourceHash":"38e1dc49f33499ca52feacbcb981e970c359b603a7e2e5254755753b2b1bdd6c","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":3323035,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":44.04,"end":48.38,"text":"さ よ な ら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":48.38,"end":61.7,"text":"ずっと 君と 同じ時間を 生きたかった","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":61.7,"end":74.98,"text":"然れど 摂理は 決して僕達を赦さないだろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":74.98,"end":88.28,"text":"幾つもの罪 重ねながらも 僕達が求めたのは――","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":88.28,"end":101.75,"text":"其れは《恩寵》 其れは《愛情》 其れは《幸福》 其れは《未来》","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":101.75,"end":115.44,"text":"暗闇の時代に生まれて 儘 君と出逢い","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":115.44,"end":129.09,"text":"惹かれ合う 其の想い 死せる後も 止められずに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":129.09,"end":141.95,"text":"宵闇の唄を集めて 此の墓碑に捧ぐ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":141.95,"end":184.11,"text":"復讐は誰が為に モリも イドも 七の墓碑銘となる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":184.11,"end":211.89,"text":"「キミが今笑っている、眩いその時代に。","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":211.89,"end":268.05,"text":"誰も恨まず、死せることを憾まず、必ず其処で逢おう」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}